# Paths Drift (and other tools that read `.ignore`, such as ripgrep) leave out:
# test data, not product code. Drift is run on its own repository in CI; see
# CONTRIBUTING.md, "Drift on its own repository". `rg --no-ignore-dot` still
# searches them.

# Fixture repositories the Rust tests and the Studio read.
crates/*/tests/fixtures/
apps/studio/fixtures/

# Code planted with known vulnerabilities, the security inventory's test data.
eval/security/planted/

# Evaluation data held out from development, by name.
eval/**/*holdout*
eval/**/*heldout*
